 DOF Canada is currently seeking a detailed oriented and client focused individual for the position of Quality Control Coordinator. A key to success for this position is the ability to collaborate with offshore and onshore personnel. The Quality Control Coordinator serves as the primary liaison between fabrication personnel, project teams, client representatives, third-party inspectors, and certification authorities to ensure inspection activities are completed, documented, and accepted. If you are looking for a dynamic environment to learn and grow your career, DOF Canada is a great opportunity!
